# standard safety net for any future root context image build that uses
# a wildcard COPY, e.g. `COPY . .`. does NOT help the one real root
# context build this repo has today though, evalhub/Containerfile.
# evalhub-cycle-runner, confirmed live: `oc start-build --from-dir=.`
# tars up and uploads the whole directory client side before this file
# is ever consulted, that upload is kept small with that build's own
# documented `--exclude` flag instead, see its Containerfile comment
.git/
.venv-kfp/
.venv/
venv/
node_modules/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
archive/
*.docx
*.pptx
*.rtf
*.excalidraw
